          <div>The Seller will not be considered to default if the delivery does not meet the Delivery Date requirements due to delayed incoming shipments caused by logistics transportation arranged by the GigaCloud. On the specified Delivery Date, the system will set the actual warehouse receiving date to + 3 business days as the new Delivery Date. The delivery will be automatically initiated on the new Delivery Date.</div>
          <div class="desc-title">Requirements for applying for Delivery Date Protection:</div>
          <div>1. The Future Goods Contract must be associated with the Incoming Shipment (Shipping Method must be "Consigned Ocean Operation").</div>
          <div>2. Total Quantity Available must be less than the Estimated Receiving Quantity (or the sum of Estimated Receiving Quantity for multiple Incoming Shipments).</div>
