x H":"12.6\"D x 12.6\"W x 26\"H","User Guide.Includes All Assembly Tools":"Yes","User Guide.Recommended Uses For Product":"Accent, Catering, Corner, Displaying, Reading","User Guide.Maximum Weight Recommendation":"20 Pounds","Recommended Number of People for Assembly":"1","User Guide.Tools Recommended For Assembly":"Allen Key","Features & Specs.Table Extension Mechanism":"Removable End Leaf","Materials & Care.Product Care Instructions":"Wipe with Damp Cloth, Wipe with Dry Cloth","Features & Specs.Minimum Required Door Width":"33 Centimeters"}', '2026-05-01T16:18:45.872Z', '2026-05-17 17:55:47');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO clean_products (id, run_id, source, url, external_id, title, price, currency, description, images, specifications, scraped_at, ingested_at) VALUES (8, 'ap-1777653950505-1v9nar', 'amazon-product', 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DN6HH7TQ?th=1', 'B0DN6HH7TQ', 'Fibogollo 2 Pack Bamboo Bed Tray Table with Folding Legs,Breakfast Trays,Serving Tray for Food and Snack,Laptop Trays for Working(Natural)', 20.98, 'USD', '【Premium Material, Naturally Durable】 Crafted from carefully selected natural bamboo, this bed tray undergoes rigorous screening and special treatment to ensure it''s both environmentally friendly and long-lasting.Its smoothly polished surface feels gentle to the touch, preventing scratches and ensuring safe use.
【Foldable design, Easy to Store】 Equipped with a convenient foldable leg mechanism, it unfolds easily for stable support when in use and folds up compactly for storage when not in use, saving space and facilitating portability.
【Considerate guardrail design】 the tray is surrounded by a guardrail, which can minimize the risk of falling items, effectively prevent food or beverage spills, protect your bed or furniture from stains, and keep the dining environment neat and elegant.
【Practical size for multiple scenarios】 With a serving tray measuring 15.75*11.81 inch,there is plenty of room for you to enjoy a quiet breakfast in bed or a leisurely sip of tea and read on the sofa, this tray table can easily accommodate your dining and shelving needs in a variety of environments.
【Cleaning and Maintenance】 To maintain the beauty and durability of the tray, please do not soak it in water.In daily use, just gently wipe it with a damp cloth to restore it as new, saving time and effort, making your life easier and more enjoyable.

